1
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:09,926
<font color="white"><i>His Majesty the King!</i></font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:01:27,629 --> 00:01:30,840
<font color="white"><i>I shall worry for you no longer.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:01:32,008 --> 00:01:32,926
<font color="white"><i>Instead,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:01:33,635 --> 00:01:34,761
<font color="white"><i>from this day on,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:01:35,261 --> 00:01:37,472
<font color="white"><i>I shall simply pray for your future.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:01:39,349 --> 00:01:41,726
<font color="white"><i>And I shall entrust</i></font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:01:42,519 --> 00:01:46,147
<font color="white"><i>those wishes to you</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>with these flower petals.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:03:21,159 --> 00:03:23,119
<font color="white">At the initial examination,</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:03:23,202 --> 00:03:27,332
<font color="white">I asked why the southern sacred herb</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">may serve as a virtue of a loyal subject.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

10
00:03:27,415 --> 00:03:29,334
<font color="white">And I found myself greatly impressed</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:03:29,417 --> 00:03:33,713
<font color="white">by the answer of the one</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who interpreted </font><font color="white"></font><font color="white"><i>The Analects</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white">' teaching,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

12
00:03:33,796 --> 00:03:35,757
<font color="white">"Be slow in speech, swift in action."</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:03:46,559 --> 00:03:49,395
<font color="white">This is that man's answer</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from the recent palace examination.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

14
00:03:49,479 --> 00:03:52,023
<font color="white">"When a new branch grows from an old tree,</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:03:52,523 --> 00:03:55,151
<font color="white">what must it cast aside,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">what must it preserve,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

16
00:03:55,235 --> 00:03:57,695
<font color="white">and toward what must it stretch forth?"</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:03:57,779 --> 00:04:01,908
<font color="white">Surely he knew this question reflected</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the predicament in which I stand.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

18
00:04:03,660 --> 00:04:04,494
<font color="white">And yet,</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:04:05,453 --> 00:04:07,163
<font color="white">what answer did he give?</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:04:10,250 --> 00:04:12,752
<font color="white">In a hall devoted to solemn scholarship,</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:04:12,835 --> 00:04:16,506
<font color="white">he dared criticize</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the failure to pursue practical truth.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

22
00:04:18,216 --> 00:04:20,301
<font color="white">No, Your Majesty. It was not--</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:04:20,385 --> 00:04:22,470
<font color="white">"Fearing to cut away the old branches</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:04:22,553 --> 00:04:24,973
<font color="white">would instead rob the tree of its life."</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:04:25,056 --> 00:04:26,349
<font color="white">Is this not what you wrote?</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:04:28,351 --> 00:04:31,479
<font color="white">In such insolently plain prose, no less!</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:04:36,776 --> 00:04:38,069
<font color="white">This is only water.</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:04:38,653 --> 00:04:40,154
<font color="white">Though it wets the white porcelain,</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:04:40,738 --> 00:04:42,740
<font color="white">it soon dries and leaves no trace.</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:04:44,575 --> 00:04:46,327
<font color="white">And this is ink.</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:04:47,620 --> 00:04:49,330
<font color="white">It does not wash away so easily.</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:04:52,041 --> 00:04:53,501
<font color="white">It stains you.</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:04:56,337 --> 00:04:57,463
<font color="white">Do you understand?</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:04:58,756 --> 00:05:02,510
<font color="white">I shall watch closely</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">whether what has been poured upon</font><font color="white"></font></font>

35
00:05:02,593 --> 00:05:05,179
<font color="white">the white porcelain that is you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">proves to be ink or water.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

36
00:05:06,514 --> 00:05:07,515
<font color="white">Yes, Your Majesty.</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:05:21,237 --> 00:05:22,071
<font color="white">Come with me.</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:05:32,498 --> 00:05:34,125
<font color="white">Chief Eunuch, can you guess</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:05:34,208 --> 00:05:37,587
<font color="white">why I spared a man</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who dared write such frivolous prose</font><font color="white"></font></font>

40
00:05:38,671 --> 00:05:40,298
<font color="white">at the solemn examination?</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:05:43,551 --> 00:05:47,305
<font color="white">He has an insolent manner</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of voicing his thoughts,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

42
00:05:48,139 --> 00:05:50,141
<font color="white">but he lacks the talent to deceive me.</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:05:52,185 --> 00:05:54,979
<font color="white">For one such as I,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">whose whole life is bound to the palace,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

44
00:05:55,688 --> 00:05:58,066
<font color="white">a man like him</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">will prove useful if kept close.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

45
00:06:02,945 --> 00:06:04,989
<font color="white">He is not one I can simply turn away.</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:06:12,497 --> 00:06:17,418
<font color="white">THE SCANDAL</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:06:18,002 --> 00:06:20,713
<font color="white">Even if the girl can read and write,</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:06:20,797 --> 00:06:23,007
<font color="white">the </font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>Elementary Learning</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">may be a touch beyond her.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

49
00:06:24,092 --> 00:06:26,094
<font color="white">If she can read it,</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:06:26,177 --> 00:06:28,721
<font color="white">then she can surely learn it as well.</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:06:29,305 --> 00:06:31,224
<font color="white">Yes, that is true.</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:06:33,059 --> 00:06:35,937
<font color="white">Still, she has never</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">properly studied before,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

53
00:06:36,020 --> 00:06:38,564
<font color="white">so I fear it may not come easily to her.</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:06:38,648 --> 00:06:40,108
<font color="white">Even as a concubine,</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:06:40,191 --> 00:06:42,193
<font color="white">she is to become</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a member of the Yoo family.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

56
00:06:42,276 --> 00:06:44,612
<font color="white">We cannot treat such a matter carelessly.</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:06:46,197 --> 00:06:48,074
<font color="white">She must at least learn</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:06:48,157 --> 00:06:50,827
<font color="white">the proper decorum</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and how to conduct herself.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

59
00:06:51,327 --> 00:06:53,287
<font color="white">Only then will So-ok</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:06:53,371 --> 00:06:55,540
<font color="white">not be scorned wherever she goes.</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:56,958
<font color="white">You are right.</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:06:58,209 --> 00:07:00,378
<font color="white">We cannot have people whispering</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:07:01,003 --> 00:07:02,713
<font color="white">that I took in an ignorant concubine.</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:07:02,797 --> 00:07:03,631
<font color="white">Very well, then.</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:07:04,507 --> 00:07:06,926
<font color="white">Please leave this matter to me, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:07:13,141 --> 00:07:14,767
<font color="white"><i>It may seem harsh,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:07:15,351 --> 00:07:17,895
<font color="white"><i>but know that it is all for your own good.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:07:19,188 --> 00:07:21,732
<font color="white"><i>Study the Introduction</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>to Confucian Learning by copying it out</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:07:22,233 --> 00:07:23,192
<font color="white"><i>a hundred times.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:07:24,402 --> 00:07:25,445
<font color="white"><i>A hundred times?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:07:45,089 --> 00:07:46,257
<font color="white">Young Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:07:47,216 --> 00:07:49,260
<font color="white">Young Madam, are you asleep?</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:07:51,888 --> 00:07:52,889
<font color="white">"Young Madam"?</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:07:59,103 --> 00:08:00,188
<font color="white">A letter for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:08:03,691 --> 00:08:04,567
<font color="white">A letter?</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:08:09,822 --> 00:08:12,575
<font color="white"><i>I deeply regret</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>breaking the alarm clock earlier today.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:08:13,743 --> 00:08:16,746
<font color="white"><i>It weighs on me that</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>I damaged something so precious to you,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:08:16,829 --> 00:08:18,206
<font color="white"><i>though unintentional.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:08:19,248 --> 00:08:21,459
<font color="white"><i>I offer my sincerest apologies.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:08:22,752 --> 00:08:24,879
<font color="white"><i>I scarcely know</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>how I might repay this wrong.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:08:26,088 --> 00:08:29,091
<font color="white"><i>Oh, I am the youngest son of</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>the Left State Councilor across the way,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:08:29,175 --> 00:08:30,718
<font color="white"><i>Kwon In-ho.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:08:30,801 --> 00:08:31,677
<font color="white">"In-ho"?</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:08:33,596 --> 00:08:34,889
<font color="white">Then give me money for it.</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:09:31,362 --> 00:09:32,655
<font color="white">Whoa, whoa.</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:09:33,614 --> 00:09:35,616
<font color="white">All right. Down now.</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:10:07,356 --> 00:10:08,608
<font color="white">Catholic faith.</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:10:09,942 --> 00:10:13,487
<font color="white">In the name of the Father,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and of the Son, and of the Holy Spirit.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

89
00:10:14,530 --> 00:10:15,990
<font color="white">-Amen.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Amen.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

90
00:10:16,073 --> 00:10:18,451
<font color="white">I will go unto the altar of God.</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:10:18,534 --> 00:10:21,621
<font color="white">Our help is in the name of the Lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:10:26,417 --> 00:10:29,003
<font color="white">The body of our Lord Jesus Christ.</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:10:55,196 --> 00:10:57,823
<font color="white">My cousin feared a palanquin</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:10:58,407 --> 00:11:01,035
<font color="white">stands out more at night.</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:11:02,578 --> 00:11:04,288
<font color="white">And so she bade me come fetch you,</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:11:04,372 --> 00:11:07,625
<font color="white">saying your journey home</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">would be far too dangerous.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

97
00:11:10,753 --> 00:11:13,255
<font color="white">I know what sort of gatherings</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">are held in this house.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

98
00:11:13,339 --> 00:11:14,340
<font color="white">That is why</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:11:14,423 --> 00:11:17,093
<font color="white">she chose to send me.</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:11:33,109 --> 00:11:35,277
<font color="white">When I was a child,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">around this time of year,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

101
00:11:35,361 --> 00:11:39,240
<font color="white">my mother would always tuck</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dried mugwort leaves into my hands.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

102
00:11:40,241 --> 00:11:41,951
<font color="white">Once the weather turned warm,</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:11:42,034 --> 00:11:43,828
<font color="white">the mosquitoes would grow fierce.</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:11:46,497 --> 00:11:50,334
<font color="white">She feared her only son's face</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">would be covered in bites.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

105
00:11:54,880 --> 00:11:56,006
<font color="white">Here you go.</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:11:58,092 --> 00:12:00,302
<font color="white">Dried mugwort leaves.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Keep them in your hand as you go.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

107
00:12:01,971 --> 00:12:04,765
<font color="white">If you were to return</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with mosquito welts upon your face,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

108
00:12:05,599 --> 00:12:07,435
<font color="white">would that not arouse suspicion at home?</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:12:08,018 --> 00:12:09,186
<font color="white">I shall be fine.</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:12:10,479 --> 00:12:12,481
<font color="white">No, you shall not.</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:12:14,733 --> 00:12:17,653
<font color="white">If suspicion falls upon you,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">your whereabouts will be discovered.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

112
00:12:17,736 --> 00:12:21,282
<font color="white">Then not only I,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">but everyone gathered here tonight,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

113
00:12:22,366 --> 00:12:23,742
<font color="white">shall come to harm.</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:12:24,326 --> 00:12:25,453
<font color="white">Now would that be fine?</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:12:27,163 --> 00:12:27,997
<font color="white">Would it?</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:12:35,504 --> 00:12:36,505
<font color="white">Here now.</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:12:45,473 --> 00:12:46,474
<font color="white">Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:12:48,100 --> 00:12:49,894
<font color="white">The palanquin has just returned.</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:12:51,103 --> 00:12:54,690
<font color="white">The Left State Councilor's daughter-in-law</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">returned home safely, I trust?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

120
00:12:54,773 --> 00:12:57,151
<font color="white">No, the palanquin returned empty.</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:12:57,234 --> 00:12:59,695
<font color="white">It turns out Lord Cho Won came</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and sent it back ahead.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

122
00:12:59,778 --> 00:13:01,030
<font color="white">What a reckless thing to do!</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:13:01,989 --> 00:13:03,407
<font color="white">Send the palanquin back at once.</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:13:06,827 --> 00:13:08,746
<font color="white">Have them wait at the entrance to Bukchon,</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:13:09,371 --> 00:13:12,166
<font color="white">and when she arrives,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">they are to escort her home without fail.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

126
00:13:17,505 --> 00:13:18,464
<font color="white">Gye-hwa.</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:13:18,547 --> 00:13:19,590
<font color="white">Yes, madam?</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:13:19,673 --> 00:13:21,842
<font color="white">If anyone were to catch sight of my cousin</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:13:21,926 --> 00:13:24,386
<font color="white">with the Left State Councilor's</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">widowed daughter-in-law,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

130
00:13:25,137 --> 00:13:27,515
<font color="white">what would become</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of this gossip-ridden Bukchon?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

131
00:13:28,933 --> 00:13:29,892
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:13:32,353 --> 00:13:34,813
<font color="white">And the Left State Councilor and his wife?</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:13:34,897 --> 00:13:36,774
<font color="white">They have not yet returned, I trust?</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:13:36,857 --> 00:13:37,733
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:13:38,234 --> 00:13:39,235
<font color="white">Then hurry.</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:14:07,721 --> 00:14:08,556
<font color="white">Oh, yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:14:09,473 --> 00:14:10,307
<font color="white">Well,</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:14:11,308 --> 00:14:13,435
<font color="white">the road is strewn with stones.</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:14:14,144 --> 00:14:17,314
<font color="white">Should you stumble,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I would not dare catch hold of you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

140
00:14:17,398 --> 00:14:18,399
<font color="white">So do take care</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:14:19,650 --> 00:14:21,360
<font color="white">and mind your step as you come.</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:14:51,807 --> 00:14:52,975
<font color="white">Please go on ahead.</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:14:53,934 --> 00:14:55,644
<font color="white">I shall rest a moment.</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:14:58,355 --> 00:14:59,189
<font color="white">Oh, dear.</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:14:59,899 --> 00:15:00,774
<font color="white">I was</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:15:01,692 --> 00:15:03,569
<font color="white">thinking only of my own pace, was I not?</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:15:04,528 --> 00:15:05,404
<font color="white">My apologies.</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:15:05,988 --> 00:15:07,281
<font color="white">Let us rest a while, then.</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:15:21,086 --> 00:15:21,921
<font color="white">Tell me.</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:15:23,756 --> 00:15:25,799
<font color="white">Why did you not take your own life?</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:15:28,052 --> 00:15:29,553
<font color="white">Had you ended it then,</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:15:30,888 --> 00:15:33,432
<font color="white">you would already have been honored</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as a virtuous woman.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

153
00:15:40,397 --> 00:15:42,024
<font color="white">My mother-in-law was ill,</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:15:43,609 --> 00:15:45,444
<font color="white">and there were too few hands at home.</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:15:47,029 --> 00:15:49,073
<font color="white">And other issues</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that caused it to be delayed.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

156
00:15:49,657 --> 00:15:52,868
<font color="white">But now that</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">my mother-in-law has recovered,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

157
00:15:52,952 --> 00:15:54,870
<font color="white">I shall soon be able</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to follow my husband…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

158
00:15:57,998 --> 00:15:58,832
<font color="white">So…</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:16:00,584 --> 00:16:01,877
<font color="white">do you really mean to do it?</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:16:03,837 --> 00:16:05,631
<font color="white">Take your own life?</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:16:09,426 --> 00:16:10,761
<font color="white">You will not be able to.</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:16:12,179 --> 00:16:15,766
<font color="white">All the more so now that you've learned</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the Lord's teachings, which cherish life.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

163
00:16:19,353 --> 00:16:22,064
<font color="white">Do not be alarmed.</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:16:22,147 --> 00:16:24,274
<font color="white">I am not unfamiliar with those teachings.</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:16:25,150 --> 00:16:28,612
<font color="white">I have always taken an interest</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in all manner of learning,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

166
00:16:28,696 --> 00:16:31,782
<font color="white">and I naturally came upon them</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">while studying Western learning.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

167
00:16:33,909 --> 00:16:34,994
<font color="white">Whoa, whoa.</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:16:37,454 --> 00:16:38,330
<font color="white">My lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:16:39,498 --> 00:16:42,084
<font color="white">Her Ladyship ordered</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that we escort her back.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

170
00:16:45,671 --> 00:16:46,505
<font color="white">Is that so?</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:16:53,846 --> 00:16:55,097
<font color="white">All right, up.</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:16:56,432 --> 00:16:57,266
<font color="white">Go.</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:17:56,658 --> 00:17:59,745
<font color="white">Madam, the palanquin has returned safely.</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:09,546
<font color="white">-My lady!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Whoa, whoa.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

175
00:18:09,630 --> 00:18:10,464
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:18:10,547 --> 00:18:11,590
<font color="white">Eun-sil.</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:18:12,382 --> 00:18:13,217
<font color="white">This way.</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:18:23,060 --> 00:18:24,895
<font color="white">All right, down now.</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:19:06,395 --> 00:19:08,313
<font color="white">INTRODUCTION</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">TO ESSENTIAL CATHOLIC TEACHINGS</font><font color="white"></font></font>

180
00:19:13,152 --> 00:19:16,029
<font color="white">"Thou shalt not kill."</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:19:19,783 --> 00:19:22,619
<font color="white">"Thou shalt not kill."</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:23:19,815 --> 00:23:20,649
<font color="white">Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:23:22,234 --> 00:23:25,320
<font color="white">If you cannot sleep,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">shall I bring you some tea?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

184
00:23:27,030 --> 00:23:28,907
<font color="white">I'm sorry to trouble you.</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:23:29,741 --> 00:23:32,244
<font color="white">I am quite all right, so you may go back.</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:23:49,427 --> 00:23:53,390
<font color="white">How could Her Ladyship make me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">copy this out a hundred times?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

187
00:23:55,142 --> 00:23:56,977
<font color="white">It was that young master</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who caused trouble,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

188
00:23:58,436 --> 00:24:00,021
<font color="white">so why is this falling on me?</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:24:12,284 --> 00:24:13,410
<font color="white">Goodness.</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:24:23,253 --> 00:24:26,173
<font color="white">YOUR APOLOGY…</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:24:57,537 --> 00:24:58,997
<font color="white"><i>Your apology</i></font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:24:59,497 --> 00:25:01,583
<font color="white"><i>made me both grateful and ashamed.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:25:02,667 --> 00:25:04,461
<font color="white"><i>The breaking of the alarm clock</i></font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:25:04,544 --> 00:25:07,088
<font color="white"><i>is no great matter,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>so please do not trouble yourself over it.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:25:09,132 --> 00:25:11,801
<font color="white"><i>But the truth is,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:25:11,885 --> 00:25:15,347
<font color="white"><i>I cut my hand upon the broken clock.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:25:16,348 --> 00:25:18,475
<font color="white"><i>I had promised the elders of the house</i></font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:25:18,558 --> 00:25:21,144
<font color="white"><i>that I would study</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>the vernacular </i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white">Elementary Learning</font><font color="white"></font></font>

199
00:25:21,728 --> 00:25:25,815
<font color="white"><i>and copy out Introduction</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>to Confucian Learning a hundred times.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:25:27,108 --> 00:25:30,278
<font color="white"><i>It is my only regret</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>that I can no longer do so.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:25:31,655 --> 00:25:33,531
<font color="white"><i>As you well know,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:25:34,241 --> 00:25:39,579
<font color="white"><i>a promise is a matter of trust</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>between people, is it not?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:25:39,663 --> 00:25:40,538
<font color="white"><i>Elementary Learning</i></font><font color="white"><font color="white">…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

204
00:25:41,414 --> 00:25:42,916
<font color="white">The vernacular </font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>Elementary Learning</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white">?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

205
00:25:43,667 --> 00:25:44,876
<font color="white"><i>I suppose</i></font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:25:46,002 --> 00:25:47,712
<font color="white"><i>I shall now lose that trust, shan't I?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:25:55,136 --> 00:25:55,971
<font color="white">62.</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:25:57,264 --> 00:25:58,098
<font color="white">63.</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:25:58,181 --> 00:26:00,183
<font color="white">I regret not bringing those to you sooner,</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:26:01,601 --> 00:26:05,146
<font color="white">but reading </font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>Elementary Learning</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">after so long brought back many memories.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

211
00:26:05,814 --> 00:26:06,856
<font color="white">65.</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:26:07,691 --> 00:26:11,361
<font color="white">-67, 68.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-I first learned it</font><font color="white"></font></font>

213
00:26:11,444 --> 00:26:13,280
<font color="white">from my elder brother when I was 5.</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:26:13,363 --> 00:26:15,532
<font color="white">He was like a teacher to me.</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:26:15,615 --> 00:26:16,449
<font color="white">70.</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:26:17,033 --> 00:26:18,702
<font color="white">-71.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Here's the truth.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

217
00:26:18,785 --> 00:26:23,665
<font color="white">-He was 20 years and 7 months old…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-20. 27.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

218
00:26:23,748 --> 00:26:26,042
<font color="white">-Maybe 8 months.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-28.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

219
00:26:26,126 --> 00:26:28,795
<font color="white">-No, 6 months old when he…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-29, 30…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

220
00:26:30,588 --> 00:26:31,423
<font color="white">30?</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:26:32,424 --> 00:26:33,633
<font color="white">For heaven's sake.</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:26:33,717 --> 00:26:36,594
<font color="white">Well, this year marks</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the end of his three-year mourning.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

223
00:26:36,678 --> 00:26:39,723
<font color="white">-Again. One.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-So I paid him a visit.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

224
00:26:39,806 --> 00:26:40,640
<font color="white">Two.</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:26:41,141 --> 00:26:43,310
<font color="white">Every one of my steps toward him…</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:26:43,393 --> 00:26:45,645
<font color="white">-One.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-…was filled with grief.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

227
00:26:45,729 --> 00:26:46,604
<font color="white">One?</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:26:47,105 --> 00:26:50,525
<font color="white">Darn it. Is he doing this on purpose?</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:26:51,109 --> 00:26:52,068
<font color="white"><i>Elementary Learning</i></font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:26:53,194 --> 00:26:55,447
<font color="white">is something that brings back</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">such tender memories</font><font color="white"></font></font>

231
00:26:56,323 --> 00:26:57,282
<font color="white">of our time together--</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:27:00,410 --> 00:27:01,703
<font color="white">Thank you for your efforts.</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:27:02,454 --> 00:27:04,998
<font color="white">But it seems one page is missing.</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:27:06,249 --> 00:27:07,625
<font color="white">There are only 99 here.</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:27:11,796 --> 00:27:14,090
<font color="white">That cannot be.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I distinctly copied a hundred.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

236
00:27:14,716 --> 00:27:17,552
<font color="white">No, I counted them twice.</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:27:21,681 --> 00:27:24,351
<font color="white">You will bring me the last page too,</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:27:25,643 --> 00:27:26,478
<font color="white">won't you?</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:27:29,230 --> 00:27:30,065
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:27:37,197 --> 00:27:38,073
<font color="white">Yes, miss.</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:27:39,407 --> 00:27:41,284
<font color="white">I shall certainly bring it.</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:28:36,047 --> 00:28:36,881
<font color="white">Well,</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:28:37,507 --> 00:28:38,341
<font color="white">here.</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:28:47,892 --> 00:28:50,019
<font color="white">Thank you, Young Master In-ho.</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:28:51,730 --> 00:28:52,605
<font color="white">Of course.</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:28:56,484 --> 00:29:00,155
<font color="white">May I ask your name?</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:29:04,659 --> 00:29:05,493
<font color="white">I am</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:29:06,703 --> 00:29:07,746
<font color="white">So-ok.</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:29:08,496 --> 00:29:09,873
<font color="white">My name is So-ok.</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:12,834
<font color="white">"So-ok."</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:29:14,544 --> 00:29:16,921
<font color="white">It suits you very well.</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:29:18,423 --> 00:29:19,507
<font color="white">"So-ok."</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:29:20,759 --> 00:29:22,093
<font color="white">Miss So-ok,</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:29:22,177 --> 00:29:25,138
<font color="white">what brings you to Lord Yoo's household?</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:29:25,221 --> 00:29:26,097
<font color="white">Me?</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:29:26,181 --> 00:29:30,351
<font color="white">Oh, well, I…</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:29:30,435 --> 00:29:33,062
<font color="white">Are you, by any chance, Lady Cho's niece</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:29:33,146 --> 00:29:35,064
<font color="white">who visited seven years ago?</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:29:36,316 --> 00:29:38,026
<font color="white">I recall my mother speaking of her.</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:29:40,111 --> 00:29:43,990
<font color="white">Then you must also be related</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to Master Cho Won.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

261
00:29:45,283 --> 00:29:47,202
<font color="white">Well, I…</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:29:49,412 --> 00:29:51,873
<font color="white">I should be going now.</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:29:52,832 --> 00:29:54,000
<font color="white">Wait.</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:29:59,714 --> 00:30:02,717
<font color="white">Well, that was rash of me.</font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:30:09,933 --> 00:30:12,310
<font color="white">I brought this from my mother's quarters</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">without her knowing.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

266
00:30:13,061 --> 00:30:15,271
<font color="white">You said you cut your hand.</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:30:17,982 --> 00:30:18,942
<font color="white">If you</font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:30:19,651 --> 00:30:22,320
<font color="white">take a bit and dab it onto the wound,</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:30:22,946 --> 00:30:24,656
<font color="white">it should heal quickly.</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:30:26,199 --> 00:30:27,700
<font color="white">Since you were hurt because of me,</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:30:28,535 --> 00:30:30,453
<font color="white">I should take responsibility, shouldn't I?</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:30:40,839 --> 00:30:41,881
<font color="white">Three…</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:30:41,965 --> 00:30:44,843
<font color="white">No, two. I shall borrow it for two days.</font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:30:46,386 --> 00:30:47,971
<font color="white">Two days from now, at this hour,</font><font color="white"></font>

275
00:30:48,054 --> 00:30:52,016
<font color="white">when the two hands of the clock</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">stretch straight across,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

276
00:30:53,476 --> 00:30:54,978
<font color="white">let us meet here again.</font><font color="white"></font>

277
00:30:59,065 --> 00:31:00,024
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

278
00:31:00,108 --> 00:31:00,942
<font color="white">Well then.</font><font color="white"></font>

279
00:31:15,748 --> 00:31:16,749
<font color="white">Mind your step.</font><font color="white"></font>

280
00:31:27,969 --> 00:31:29,304
<font color="white">When the two clocks… No.</font><font color="white"></font>

281
00:31:29,387 --> 00:31:31,347
<font color="white">When the two hands</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">stretch straight across.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

282
00:32:15,141 --> 00:32:17,018
<font color="white">Let me think.</font><font color="white"></font>

283
00:32:18,436 --> 00:32:22,649
<font color="white">How long has it been</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">since we last shared a drink?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

284
00:32:23,650 --> 00:32:28,029
<font color="white">The last time was</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when I visited Hwaseong, was it not?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

285
00:32:28,112 --> 00:32:30,073
<font color="white">Yes, you came</font><font color="white"></font>

286
00:32:31,574 --> 00:32:33,618
<font color="white">for the relocation of Hyollyungwon.</font><font color="white"></font>

287
00:32:37,997 --> 00:32:40,625
<font color="white">You see,</font><font color="white"></font>

288
00:32:41,334 --> 00:32:44,545
<font color="white">I simply cannot understand.</font><font color="white"></font>

289
00:32:44,629 --> 00:32:45,964
<font color="white">What do you mean?</font><font color="white"></font>

290
00:32:46,047 --> 00:32:48,341
<font color="white">The heart of a father…</font><font color="white"></font>

291
00:32:51,260 --> 00:32:53,012
<font color="white">who locked away</font><font color="white"></font>

292
00:32:53,096 --> 00:32:56,307
<font color="white">the son he cherished so dearly</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in a rice chest.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

293
00:32:57,183 --> 00:32:59,268
<font color="white">How could he do such a thing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to his precious child?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

294
00:33:00,603 --> 00:33:01,854
<font color="white">But you see.</font><font color="white"></font>

295
00:33:01,938 --> 00:33:03,064
<font color="white">Yes?</font><font color="white"></font>

296
00:33:03,147 --> 00:33:07,193
<font color="white">The son defied his father</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">until he was shut inside that rice chest.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

297
00:33:10,530 --> 00:33:11,990
<font color="white">I believe I may understand him.</font><font color="white"></font>

298
00:33:13,908 --> 00:33:15,118
<font color="white">To a son,</font><font color="white"></font>

299
00:33:15,868 --> 00:33:18,997
<font color="white">his father may well be a world</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with which he can never reconcile.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

300
00:33:19,664 --> 00:33:20,915
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

301
00:33:21,541 --> 00:33:23,543
<font color="white">Yes, indeed.</font><font color="white"></font>

302
00:33:45,481 --> 00:33:46,941
<font color="white">I suppose the Crown Prince…</font><font color="white"></font>

303
00:33:49,736 --> 00:33:50,820
<font color="white">and I…</font><font color="white"></font>

304
00:33:55,908 --> 00:33:56,868
<font color="white">are both…</font><font color="white"></font>

305
00:34:01,330 --> 00:34:03,791
<font color="white">but men defeated</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">before the name of "father."</font><font color="white"></font></font>

306
00:34:27,648 --> 00:34:28,941
<font color="white">Make it light and clear.</font><font color="white"></font>

307
00:34:29,734 --> 00:34:31,778
<font color="white">My cousin prefers it that way.</font><font color="white"></font>

308
00:34:31,861 --> 00:34:32,987
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

309
00:35:00,723 --> 00:35:03,101
<font color="white">If I go on soaking myself in drink</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">like this again,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

310
00:35:03,726 --> 00:35:06,062
<font color="white">I swear I'll change my name</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from Yoo to Cho.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

311
00:35:07,230 --> 00:35:10,358
<font color="white">Your jest goes too far, Minister Cho.</font><font color="white"></font>

312
00:35:12,360 --> 00:35:13,569
<font color="white">My head is splitting.</font><font color="white"></font>

313
00:35:13,653 --> 00:35:15,446
<font color="white">I wish you had stopped me.</font><font color="white"></font>

314
00:35:16,531 --> 00:35:18,032
<font color="white">My lord!</font><font color="white"></font>

315
00:35:18,616 --> 00:35:19,534
<font color="white">My lord!</font><font color="white"></font>

316
00:35:19,617 --> 00:35:20,952
<font color="white">From the palace…</font><font color="white"></font>

317
00:35:21,035 --> 00:35:22,620
<font color="white">Someone has come from the palace.</font><font color="white"></font>

318
00:35:22,703 --> 00:35:24,872
<font color="white">Did you say the palace?</font><font color="white"></font>

319
00:35:24,956 --> 00:35:25,873
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

320
00:35:26,457 --> 00:35:30,169
<font color="white">I thought His Majesty had taken offense</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and meant to dismiss me from office.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

321
00:35:30,253 --> 00:35:32,171
<font color="white">Have I not always told you not to worry?</font><font color="white"></font>

322
00:35:32,255 --> 00:35:34,757
<font color="white">None of it was ever your intention.</font><font color="white"></font>

323
00:35:34,841 --> 00:35:38,511
<font color="white">I knew His Majesty</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">would surely know your true heart.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

324
00:35:39,554 --> 00:35:40,721
<font color="white">You think so?</font><font color="white"></font>

325
00:35:43,558 --> 00:35:46,060
<font color="white">-Quickly now. He has arrived.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Right.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

326
00:35:46,644 --> 00:35:48,604
<font color="white">Right, this is no time for this.</font><font color="white"></font>

327
00:35:48,688 --> 00:35:50,898
<font color="white">I must hurry.</font><font color="white"></font>

328
00:35:56,696 --> 00:35:59,407
<font color="white">I am ready. Go on, read it.</font><font color="white"></font>

329
00:36:00,867 --> 00:36:02,952
<font color="white">-No, it is not--</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-What are you waiting for?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

330
00:36:03,035 --> 00:36:05,955
<font color="white">His Majesty calls for me.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">We must not waste a moment.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

331
00:36:06,539 --> 00:36:07,832
<font color="white">No, that is not it!</font><font color="white"></font>

332
00:36:09,750 --> 00:36:10,668
<font color="white">His Majesty</font><font color="white"></font>

333
00:36:11,502 --> 00:36:13,754
<font color="white">seeks one named Cho Won.</font><font color="white"></font>

334
00:36:19,385 --> 00:36:21,679
<font color="white">So it is not me?</font><font color="white"></font>

335
00:36:22,805 --> 00:36:24,098
<font color="white">Cho Won, step forward.</font><font color="white"></font>

336
00:36:33,441 --> 00:36:35,443
<font color="white">His Majesty ordered</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that you read it yourself.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

337
00:36:55,129 --> 00:36:58,799
<font color="white">READ THE ROYAL COMMAND PERSONALLY</font><font color="white"></font>

338
00:36:58,883 --> 00:37:02,303
<font color="white">AND ENTER THE PALACE AT ONCE</font><font color="white"></font>

339
00:37:08,893 --> 00:37:10,978
<font color="white">Wait just a moment!</font><font color="white"></font>

340
00:37:13,940 --> 00:37:15,233
<font color="white">Pour every last bit in.</font><font color="white"></font>

341
00:37:19,779 --> 00:37:21,530
<font color="white">Bring that over here!</font><font color="white"></font>

342
00:37:21,614 --> 00:37:22,823
<font color="white">Move it!</font><font color="white"></font>

343
00:37:22,907 --> 00:37:26,285
<font color="white">We shall use five more </font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>mal</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white"> of paste,</font><font color="white"></font>
<font color="white">so keep that in mind.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

344
00:37:28,287 --> 00:37:29,247
<font color="white">Who might you be?</font><font color="white"></font>

345
00:37:30,373 --> 00:37:31,624
<font color="white">Who might you be?</font><font color="white"></font>

346
00:37:31,707 --> 00:37:34,669
<font color="white">It seems I have found the right place.</font><font color="white"></font>

347
00:38:04,573 --> 00:38:06,409
<font color="white">Take it easy!</font><font color="white"></font>

348
00:38:07,285 --> 00:38:10,705
<font color="white">Even if we work through the night,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">can we really sell any of this?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

349
00:38:10,788 --> 00:38:12,415
<font color="white">Enough of your nonsense.</font><font color="white"></font>

350
00:38:14,792 --> 00:38:17,086
<font color="white">So what brings you here?</font><font color="white"></font>

351
00:38:20,047 --> 00:38:21,173
<font color="white">I heard that</font><font color="white"></font>

352
00:38:22,174 --> 00:38:24,093
<font color="white">you were starving before.</font><font color="white"></font>

353
00:38:24,176 --> 00:38:26,721
<font color="white">Have things improved at all since then?</font><font color="white"></font>

354
00:38:26,804 --> 00:38:27,888
<font color="white">What do you think?</font><font color="white"></font>

355
00:38:29,181 --> 00:38:30,808
<font color="white">Quite a few officials</font><font color="white"></font>

356
00:38:31,475 --> 00:38:33,477
<font color="white">have caught hell because of you.</font><font color="white"></font>

357
00:38:34,312 --> 00:38:36,897
<font color="white">I feared</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">there might have been retaliation,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

358
00:38:36,981 --> 00:38:38,816
<font color="white">so I came to see for myself.</font><font color="white"></font>

359
00:38:48,659 --> 00:38:50,369
<font color="white">So you met with him?</font><font color="white"></font>

360
00:38:50,453 --> 00:38:52,621
<font color="white">I received your secret letter.</font><font color="white"></font>

361
00:38:53,581 --> 00:38:56,709
<font color="white">And so, I have already ordered</font><font color="white"></font>

362
00:38:57,209 --> 00:38:59,420
<font color="white">that all those involved</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">be summoned to Hanyang at once.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

363
00:38:59,503 --> 00:39:01,130
<font color="white">My apologies, Your Majesty.</font><font color="white"></font>

364
00:39:01,213 --> 00:39:04,008
<font color="white">It seems the matter concerns</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">more than that fellow Gil-san alone.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

365
00:39:06,052 --> 00:39:07,094
<font color="white">I had assumed as much.</font><font color="white"></font>

366
00:39:08,137 --> 00:39:11,766
<font color="white">Corruption spreads</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">like wildfire by its very nature.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

367
00:39:13,768 --> 00:39:15,394
<font color="white">My apologies, Your Majesty.</font><font color="white"></font>

368
00:39:15,478 --> 00:39:17,688
<font color="white">You have nothing to apologize for.</font><font color="white"></font>

369
00:39:20,483 --> 00:39:21,525
<font color="white">Left State Councilor.</font><font color="white"></font>

370
00:39:21,609 --> 00:39:22,568
<font color="white">Yes, Your Majesty.</font><font color="white"></font>

371
00:39:26,155 --> 00:39:28,699
<font color="white">I shall entrust him with a task.</font><font color="white"></font>

372
00:39:30,493 --> 00:39:31,827
<font color="white">Please give your command.</font><font color="white"></font>

373
00:39:34,580 --> 00:39:36,957
<font color="white">I confide this in you because I trust you.</font><font color="white"></font>

374
00:39:37,541 --> 00:39:39,502
<font color="white">All that I have undertaken in Hwaseong</font><font color="white"></font>

375
00:39:40,211 --> 00:39:44,799
<font color="white">may well be said to be driven by</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">my filial devotion to my late father.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

376
00:39:45,383 --> 00:39:46,384
<font color="white">For that reason,</font><font color="white"></font>

377
00:39:47,259 --> 00:39:48,552
<font color="white">I cannot allow</font><font color="white"></font>

378
00:39:48,636 --> 00:39:51,472
<font color="white">even the slightest corruption</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in matters concerning it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

379
00:40:02,191 --> 00:40:03,192
<font color="white">My lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

380
00:40:04,193 --> 00:40:06,821
<font color="white">What brings you back to tobacco again?</font><font color="white"></font>

381
00:40:10,199 --> 00:40:11,075
<font color="white">This is</font><font color="white"></font>

382
00:40:12,493 --> 00:40:14,870
<font color="white">a book written by that Cho Won, is it not?</font><font color="white"></font>

383
00:40:18,124 --> 00:40:18,999
<font color="white">The other day,</font><font color="white"></font>

384
00:40:20,251 --> 00:40:22,628
<font color="white">I crossed paths with him in the street.</font><font color="white"></font>

385
00:40:23,212 --> 00:40:26,924
<font color="white">He wore such an unsettling smile,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as if he were lusting after women.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

386
00:40:27,550 --> 00:40:29,218
<font color="white">It did not sit well with me.</font><font color="white"></font>

387
00:40:29,760 --> 00:40:30,970
<font color="white">Did you not say</font><font color="white"></font>

388
00:40:32,012 --> 00:40:35,307
<font color="white">he had fallen out</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of the King's favor as well?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

389
00:40:40,563 --> 00:40:41,397
<font color="white">I believe</font><font color="white"></font>

390
00:40:43,399 --> 00:40:45,276
<font color="white">he may soon prove quite useful.</font><font color="white"></font>

391
00:40:45,860 --> 00:40:47,862
<font color="white">You should know that I have told him</font><font color="white"></font>

392
00:40:48,863 --> 00:40:50,739
<font color="white">to stay at our house for a while.</font><font color="white"></font>

393
00:41:01,375 --> 00:41:02,626
<font color="white">This is all we need to pack?</font><font color="white"></font>

394
00:41:03,752 --> 00:41:04,587
<font color="white">You rascal.</font><font color="white"></font>

395
00:41:05,337 --> 00:41:08,215
<font color="white">Why do you look so pleased?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">It is only nearby, so enough already.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

396
00:41:09,967 --> 00:41:11,343
<font color="white">Are you leaving now?</font><font color="white"></font>

397
00:41:11,927 --> 00:41:12,761
<font color="white">Goodness.</font><font color="white"></font>

398
00:41:13,554 --> 00:41:16,390
<font color="white">Are you here to see me off?</font><font color="white"></font>

399
00:41:17,725 --> 00:41:19,268
<font color="white">I am most honored.</font><font color="white"></font>

400
00:41:19,351 --> 00:41:21,061
<font color="white">I must say, I am quite impressed.</font><font color="white"></font>

401
00:41:21,562 --> 00:41:23,647
<font color="white">You somehow managed</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to get into that household.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

402
00:41:24,482 --> 00:41:26,108
<font color="white">Heaven must be helping me.</font><font color="white"></font>

403
00:41:27,359 --> 00:41:28,319
<font color="white">Though I wonder</font><font color="white"></font>

404
00:41:28,903 --> 00:41:30,070
<font color="white">who it's truly helping.</font><font color="white"></font>

405
00:41:31,030 --> 00:41:32,448
<font color="white">Does this heavenly fortune</font><font color="white"></font>

406
00:41:33,032 --> 00:41:34,825
<font color="white">favor you, my dear cousin,</font><font color="white"></font>

407
00:41:35,993 --> 00:41:37,328
<font color="white">or me?</font><font color="white"></font>

408
00:41:39,788 --> 00:41:41,499
<font color="white">To be blessed with heaven's favor,</font><font color="white"></font>

409
00:41:41,582 --> 00:41:44,502
<font color="white">you have lived far too debauched a life,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">have you not?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

410
00:41:46,212 --> 00:41:47,546
<font color="white">Debauched, you say.</font><font color="white"></font>

411
00:41:48,797 --> 00:41:51,467
<font color="white">Wait till our wager is over,</font><font color="white"></font>

412
00:41:52,301 --> 00:41:53,802
<font color="white">then see for yourself.</font><font color="white"></font>

413
00:41:54,803 --> 00:41:55,638
<font color="white">Cousin.</font><font color="white"></font>

414
00:41:56,722 --> 00:41:58,349
<font color="white">I shall be going now.</font><font color="white"></font>

415
00:42:12,154 --> 00:42:15,157
<font color="white">Madam, a messenger just dropped this off.</font><font color="white"></font>

416
00:42:15,241 --> 00:42:16,825
<font color="white">It came from the Tobacco Shop,</font><font color="white"></font>

417
00:42:16,909 --> 00:42:19,203
<font color="white">and it is addressed to Lord Cho Won.</font><font color="white"></font>

418
00:42:19,286 --> 00:42:20,621
<font color="white">Shall I take it to him?</font><font color="white"></font>

419
00:42:23,165 --> 00:42:25,000
<font color="white">Since it came from the Tobacco Shop,</font><font color="white"></font>

420
00:42:25,084 --> 00:42:26,710
<font color="white">I assume it is tobacco.</font><font color="white"></font>

421
00:42:28,671 --> 00:42:31,465
<font color="white">Yet that scarlet silk troubles me greatly.</font><font color="white"></font>

422
00:42:32,299 --> 00:42:34,927
<font color="white">I shall deliver it myself,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so leave it in the inner quarters.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

423
00:42:35,427 --> 00:42:36,262
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

424
00:42:52,027 --> 00:42:53,696
<font color="white">I have long awaited your arrival.</font><font color="white"></font>

425
00:42:54,863 --> 00:42:55,739
<font color="white">This way, please.</font><font color="white"></font>

426
00:43:02,538 --> 00:43:04,331
<font color="white">This is the rear garden of our house.</font><font color="white"></font>

427
00:43:05,165 --> 00:43:07,001
<font color="white">Now that you have set foot</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in this household,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

428
00:43:07,084 --> 00:43:09,169
<font color="white">you must put aside any thought of fleeing.</font><font color="white"></font>

429
00:43:09,837 --> 00:43:14,383
<font color="white">There is so much I wish to ask,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">hear, and learn from you, sir.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

430
00:43:19,680 --> 00:43:20,723
<font color="white">Oh, my.</font><font color="white"></font>

431
00:43:22,391 --> 00:43:25,894
<font color="white">Over there</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">are my sister-in-law's quarters.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

432
00:43:25,978 --> 00:43:27,730
<font color="white">As you must have seen,</font><font color="white"></font>

433
00:43:27,813 --> 00:43:31,442
<font color="white">she is still in mourning</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for my late brother.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

434
00:43:32,610 --> 00:43:33,819
<font color="white">Is that so?</font><font color="white"></font>

435
00:43:34,945 --> 00:43:36,405
<font color="white">Yes. This way, please.</font><font color="white"></font>

436
00:47:50,951 --> 00:47:54,913
<font color="white">Subtitle translation by: Yoonjung Song</font><font color="white"></font>

